ns","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-06-25T13:40:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T18:54:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T17:25:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on Linux and Windows (Vulkan) in 4.7 and on master commit: fd98f8452afdc80236ba01f69f27537f5a368dc1\n- Not Reproducible in 4.6.3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed, 10 Jun 2026 08:58:02 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 9 185H (22 threads) - 30.73 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis issue popped up on our main level scene. The background and the minimap overlay both used a subviewport with a different MSAA level resulting in the crash once all the required scenes were added to the main scene.\n\nSimplified Node setup:\n<img width=\"418\" height=\"197\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/293e9e63-eb17-4bbb-9b0c-aaa326709cab\" />\n* WorldEnvironment needs background_mode: Canvas\n* Sprite displays the Godot logo\n* SubViewport has update_mode set to Always and MSAA 2D set to 2x or 4x\n* SubViewport2 has update_mode set to Always and MSAA 2D set to a higher mode than SubViewport\n\nWhen starting the scene it crashes with the error:\n```\nE 0:00:06:226   fence_wait: Couldn't wait for Vulkan fence (VkResult error -4).\n  <C++ Error>   Condition \"err != VK_SUCCESS\" is true. Returning: FAILED\n  <C++ Source>  drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp:3050 @ fence_wait()\n```\n\nDoesn't crash with setup:\n* Both subviewports use the same MSAA mode.\n* The first subviewport has a higher mode then the second.\n* One of the subviewports has MSAA disabled.\n* With a third subviewport I can't get it to crash at all.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe MRP has both subviewports set to 2x to avoid the editor crashing on startup. Switch to Script view and change SubViewport2 to 4x or 8x to make the scene crash on startup.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[msaa-vulkan-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29340025/msaa-vulkan-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120637/reactions","